{"id": "family-health-cross-session-001", "category": "family_long_memory", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-0f22f2cf", "family_id": "bench-health-0f22f2cf", "answer": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "5196bd0a-dc61-483b-938f-0ab5a1b0480d", "latency_ms": 3784.44, "turns": [{"response": "听到您头疼不舒服，我有点担心您。您先坐下来歇一歇，喝点温水。\n\n如果头疼得厉害，或者伴有头晕、想吐这些情况，一定要告诉家里人，或者让家人带您去医院看看。要是家里没人，您也可以随时喊我帮忙联系家人。\n\n您先好好休息一下，我在这儿陪着您。记得别太累着。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-0f22f2cf-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 3.769139, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:25.288884", "trace_id": "7bc3f227-13c7-4d13-9ab6-cecb898526b9"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-0f22f2cf-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.00121, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:25.293655", "trace_id": "5196bd0a-dc61-483b-938f-0ab5a1b0480d"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": {"family_id": "bench-health-0f22f2cf", "person_name": "奶奶", "events": [{"event_id": "dcf85236-d0c9-4884-8b70-aeef357c6f7a", "family_id": "bench-health-0f22f2cf", "person_name": "奶奶", "symptom": "头疼", "source_session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-0f22f2cf-grandma", "occurred_at": "2026-08-12T16:58:25.287186", "created_at": "2026-08-12T16:58:25.287186"}]}}
{"id": "family-health-multiple-members-002", "category": "family_long_memory", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-47aac350", "family_id": "bench-multi-47aac350", "answer": "奶奶今天提到过咳嗽。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "4a46041b-e38a-4b3d-9cc3-e496f98d39fd", "latency_ms": 10815.34, "turns": [{"response": "听到您有点咳嗽，我挺担心的。您先别着急，多喝点温水润润喉咙会舒服些。\n\n如果咳嗽比较厉害，或者伴有发烧、胸闷这些情况，建议您及时联系家人，或者去医院看看。家里要是没人陪着您，记得告诉我们一声，也可以拨打120求助。\n\n您咳嗽多久了？有没有其他不舒服的地方？我可以帮您记下来提醒家人多关注您。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-47aac350-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.242619, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:29.540275", "trace_id": "e2cfab27-e7de-45a2-ac63-ecc115f48ad3"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "听您说头晕，我很担心您。您先找个地方坐下休息一会儿，喝点温水，千万别着急走动。\n\n如果头晕得厉害，或者伴有手脚发麻、说话不清楚的情况，一定要马上联系家人或者拨打急救电话。您身边现在有人陪着吗？\n\n等您感觉好些了，记得把这件事告诉家里人。您平时血压怎么样？有没有按时吃药呀？这些对头晕都有关系。如果需要的话，我可以帮您把今天的情况记下来，方便您和家人沟通。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-47aac350-grandpa", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 6.559773, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:36.103604", "trace_id": "78dcc070-62de-4a92-80c4-65fa346dd72b"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过咳嗽。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-47aac350-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001286, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:36.108516", "trace_id": "4a46041b-e38a-4b3d-9cc3-e496f98d39fd"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": {"family_id": "bench-multi-47aac350", "person_name": "奶奶", "events": [{"event_id": "c3144e41-7fa0-4ee9-b099-b3fbc3aa2ac7", "family_id": "bench-multi-47aac350", "person_name": "奶奶", "symptom": "咳嗽", "source_session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-47aac350-grandma", "occurred_at": "2026-08-12T16:58:29.538414", "created_at": "2026-08-12T16:58:29.538414"}]}}
{"id": "family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003", "category": "family_long_memory", "session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-a94a7948", "family_id": "bench-grandchild-a94a7948", "answer": "外婆今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "6024bcbd-c95c-4434-9508-582db29d9210", "latency_ms": 5588.39, "turns": [{"response": "奶奶，腿疼这两天一定让您不太舒服吧。您先别急着走动太多，多坐下歇一歇。如果腿疼得厉害，或者肿了、走不了路，一定要马上告诉家人，或者打电话给儿女们。\n\n建议您今天少走远路，晚上可以用温水泡泡脚，放松一下。要是疼得持续加重，最好让家人陪您去医院看看医生。\n\n您要是愿意告诉我腿是怎么疼的，是酸胀还是刺痛，我也好帮您多留意着点。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-a94a7948-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 5.578596, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:41.692033", "trace_id": "9dc14d42-5a2e-4cfa-a195-3a6bccdb9dbb"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "外婆今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-a94a7948-child", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001314, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T16:58:41.696987", "trace_id": "6024bcbd-c95c-4434-9508-582db29d9210"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": {"family_id": "bench-grandchild-a94a7948", "person_name": "外婆", "events": [{"event_id": "08b60b91-4d50-4679-bee7-d4f9d1a7fe7c", "family_id": "bench-grandchild-a94a7948", "person_name": "外婆", "symptom": "腿疼", "source_session_id": "eval-family-health-recall-by-grandchild-003-a94a7948-grandma", "occurred_at": "2026-08-12T16:58:41.690073", "created_at": "2026-08-12T16:58:41.690073"}]}}
